# Added by Cargo
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contains compiled binaries, build artifacts, and dependency code
/target/

# Cargo Lockfile
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Remove the exclamation mark if you are writing a binary/application.
# Keep the exclamation mark if you are writing a library crate.
Cargo.lock

# Development & Tooling Leftovers
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# Internal compiler error stack dumps
rustc-ice-*.txt

# Mutation testing data (cargo-mutants)
**/mutants.out*/

# MSVC Windows Build & Debugging
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Visual Studio / Windows debugging symbols
*.pdb
